"Harmonised notice of the European Union on the legal guarantee of conformity"
msgstr ""
"Fógra comhchuibhithe an Aontais Eorpaigh maidir leis an ráthaíocht "
"dhlíthiúil comhréireachta"

#. module: deltatech_website_legal_guarantee
