"In some cases you may ask for a price reduction or terminate the\n"
"                                    contract, for example when repair or replacement was refused or not\n"
"                                    carried out."
msgstr ""
"I gcásanna áirithe, féadfaidh tú íosú praghais a iarraidh nó an conradh a "
"fhoirceannadh, mar shampla nuair a diúltaíodh don deisiú nó don athsholáthar"
" nó nuair nár cuireadh i gcrích é."

